WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.101
Distance keeps everyone safe.

2
00:00:02.301 --> 00:00:07.905
Up close - under half a metre - is personal space: never go there.

3
00:00:08.105 --> 00:00:12.508
Normal talking distance is about one metre, when things are calm.

4
00:00:12.708 --> 00:00:17.110
When tension rises, move back to between one and three metres.

5
00:00:17.311 --> 00:00:20.112
Stand at a slight angle, not square-on.

6
00:00:20.312 --> 00:00:22.714
Keep your hands open and visible.

7
00:00:22.914 --> 00:00:28.918
Keep a way out behind you - and never trap the fan in a corner.


8
00:00:29.918 --> 00:00:31.919
Don't deal with conflict alone.

9
00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:33.520
Work in pairs.

10
00:00:33.721 --> 00:00:36.122
One marshal talks - that's contact.

11
00:00:36.322 --> 00:00:39.124
The other stands back, watches the fan,

12
00:00:39.324 --> 00:00:44.127
the crowd and his friends, with the radio ready - that's cover.

13
00:00:44.327 --> 00:00:46.728
Tell your supervisor before you go.

14
00:00:46.928 --> 00:00:49.330
Never walk into a crowd alone.

15
00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:52.732
And never reach in, grab or hold anyone.

16
00:00:52.932 --> 00:00:55.734
Marshals do not touch fans - ever.

